# Alias: settings (goal typed, kept on the card), a turn with a guess, a skip,
# a pause to end it, the last word, the review changing a mark, the next team's
# scoreboard, ending the game, the rules
#! app party
5 shot menu
DOWN 5 shot settings
DOWN DOWN 5 1 0 CENTER shot goal
RSOFT 5 shot again
RSOFT UP 5 shot scores
5 shot word
5 HASH shot counted
LSOFT shot pause
DOWN 5 shot last
5 shot review
5 shot toggled
RSOFT shot next
RSOFT shot confirm
DOWN 5 shot ended
DOWN DOWN 5 shot rules
